  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\frac{x}{4}} \\frac{\\int_2^{\\sec ^2 x} f(t) d t}{x^2-\\frac{\\pi^2}{16}}$ $\\left[\\therefore \\frac{0}{0}\\right.$ form $]$\nLet\n$$\n\\begin{array}{ll}\n\\text { Let } & L=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\frac{x}{4}} \\frac{f\\left(\\sec ^2 x\\right) 2 \\sec x \\sec x \\tan x}{2 x} \\\\\n\\therefore & L=\\frac{2 f(2)}{\\pi / 4}=\\frac{8 f(2)}{\\pi}\n\\end{array}\n$$",
